IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `bsia-buses`

-- Bus Services Industry Act 2015, ss 2, 11, 22, 28B, 28F, 28G, 28R and 42AA to 42AG -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_bus-services-industry-act-2015.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

